      "path": "src/persistence/migrations/v2-to-v3.ts",
      "content": "The v2→v3 transform removes `exposureStart` but still copies the existing private `activityDesc` field from v2 Trades. Unlike migrations starting at v1, migrations starting at v2 never run `v1ToV2`, which is currently the only transform that strips that field. This violates A139's authoritative-only transform contract and leaves source-derived private state in the candidate until rebuild. Strip both private Trade fields here so direct v2 migrations also produce an authoritative-only candidate.",
